WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.380
- Hey, we're the cast of One Piece.

00:00:01.380 --> 00:00:04.290
- We had so much fun
shooting this show together.

00:00:04.290 --> 00:00:06.480
Now we're about to show
you some personal photos

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:08.250
from production that
we have on our phones.

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:09.676
- What's on my phone?

00:00:09.676 --> 00:00:11.536
(cast gasping)

00:00:11.536 --> 00:00:12.369
- Is that?

00:00:12.369 --> 00:00:13.260
- That's Peter.

00:00:13.260 --> 00:00:15.573
- [Emily] Both of y'all's
teeth are so white.

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:17.850
- Oh,

00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:18.683
that's mine.

00:00:18.683 --> 00:00:20.550
Emily, actually, you gave this to me.

00:00:20.550 --> 00:00:22.620
- You were like, just
so effortlessly cool.

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:23.970
I was like, "Oh, can I
please take a picture?

00:00:23.970 --> 00:00:24.803
Is this okay?"

00:00:24.803 --> 00:00:25.980
And then you were like.

00:00:25.980 --> 00:00:28.140
- And then Iñaki comes right next to me.

00:00:28.140 --> 00:00:29.353
- Yeah.

00:00:29.353 --> 00:00:31.890
(cast cheering)

00:00:31.890 --> 00:00:33.270
- Oh the COVID mask.

00:00:33.270 --> 00:00:34.800
- We shot during COVID

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:36.570
so we had to wear these masks every day.

00:00:36.570 --> 00:00:38.310
We were the only ones
that you got the mask

00:00:38.310 --> 00:00:39.930
where you could see their faces,

00:00:39.930 --> 00:00:42.184
so I started drawing little mustaches.

00:00:42.184 --> 00:00:45.450
(cast gasping)

00:00:45.450 --> 00:00:47.070
- That day was the first day

00:00:47.070 --> 00:00:48.930
I had to do any stunts on the show,

00:00:48.930 --> 00:00:51.060
and I remember I was so
preoccupied with going,

00:00:51.060 --> 00:00:53.130
it was full of SAs on both floors,

00:00:53.130 --> 00:00:54.810
and everyone was looking
down as it was happening.

00:00:54.810 --> 00:00:56.400
I just remember thinking, "If you slip

00:00:56.400 --> 00:00:58.213
and fall on your ass right now."

00:00:58.213 --> 00:00:59.880
- Oh, look at that picture.

00:00:59.880 --> 00:01:00.713
Remember that day Mackenyu?

00:01:00.713 --> 00:01:01.546
- Yeah.

00:01:01.546 --> 00:01:02.700
Cape Town.

00:01:02.700 --> 00:01:03.533
Right?

00:01:03.533 --> 00:01:05.340
- I remember we went to
have some lunch or dinner

00:01:05.340 --> 00:01:07.200
or something like that, and
then we took that picture.

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:08.340
I was so excited.

00:01:08.340 --> 00:01:09.930
The fans were waiting
for that picture, huh?

00:01:09.930 --> 00:01:11.460
- I know, they were all like, "Oh my God.

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:12.293
They found Zoro.

00:01:12.293 --> 00:01:13.804
They found Zoro!"

00:01:13.804 --> 00:01:15.330
- Ooh.
- Oh my God.

00:01:15.330 --> 00:01:18.000
Okay, so I started doing,
it started with Iñaki

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:20.280
where he would take naps

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:22.080
in the morning in the makeup chair,

00:01:22.080 --> 00:01:25.290
and so I would take selfies
while he was sleeping,

00:01:25.290 --> 00:01:28.800
and he found out, he has some of me,

00:01:28.800 --> 00:01:31.860
and then Langley, who
plays Axe-Hand Morgan

00:01:31.860 --> 00:01:33.603
ended up falling asleep and so we.

00:01:33.603 --> 00:01:34.436
- Got 'em!

00:01:34.436 --> 00:01:35.269
(cast chanting "got 'em")

00:01:35.269 --> 00:01:36.120
- Oh, are you kidding me?

00:01:36.120 --> 00:01:36.953
There it is!

00:01:36.953 --> 00:01:38.100
- Oh!

00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:39.300
I remember that day.

00:01:39.300 --> 00:01:41.400
I had to film this underwater scene,

00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:44.070
and Taz just out of sympathy,

00:01:44.070 --> 00:01:45.810
just decided to jump into water,

00:01:45.810 --> 00:01:49.350
even though he didn't have
to just to bring me company.

00:01:49.350 --> 00:01:52.080
Like that's just the kind
of guy he is, you know?

00:01:52.080 --> 00:01:53.873
- Such a Taz-y move.

00:01:53.873 --> 00:01:55.380
- Thank you all so much for watching

00:01:55.380 --> 00:01:58.473
and check out One Piece only on Netflix.

